The Trips button of AirTrail's dock: one link more, beside Statistics, to the trips page of
tripbox. This patch modifies AirTrail (copyright its authors, https://github.com/johanohly/AirTrail)
and is offered under AirTrail's own licence, the GNU General Public License version 3. An image
built with it is AirTrail, modified.

Written for AirTrail v3.14.0. It only adds lines, to two files:
- src/lib/components/NavigationDock.svelte: the Luggage icon, the Trips item and the item in the
  dock, after Statistics and before More, for everyone signed in (it is a link);
- src/lib/components/dock/DockTooltipItem.svelte: data-sveltekit-reload on a dock link, so the
  browser, not AirTrail's own router, opens its address (at one hostname /tripbox is no page of
  AirTrail's).
The Trips item's address is a placeholder; integrations/airtrail/build.sh puts the trips page's
address in its place.

